athnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9356em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2644em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是扩散张量的三个特征值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其均值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 1，纤维方向越一致、连接越完整；弓状束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 下降，常预示复述与句法能力受损。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络视角-语言区如何动态协同\">网络视角：语言区如何动态协同</h2><p>把语言网络看成静态的「区域分工图」是危险的。现代连接组学强调，语言加工是网络节点间动态、按需的协同：同一个脑区在不同任务里参与不同的功能联盟，激活强度随任务难度、可预测性、注意状态实时调整。例如布罗卡区在简单陈述句里只轻度激活，在多重嵌套的复杂句里激活骤增——它的角色取决于当下计算的需求，而非固定不变。</p>\n<p>这种动态性也是 <a href=\"intro-and-brain-basis\">神经语言学导论与语言的脑基础</a> 中「网络化专门化」的微观写照：节点有专长，但功能由连接的瞬时配置决定。它解释了为何同一处损伤在不同病人身上后果差异很大——网络的冗余与重路由能力因人而异。对语言加工的实时追踪（见 <a href=\"../language-processing/speech-lexical-processing\">语音与词汇加工</a> 与 <a href=\"../language-processing/syntactic-processing\">句法加工与神经机制</a>）正是要捕捉这种毫秒尺度上的网络重构，而非给某个词贴上「在哪个区」的静态标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超越左脑-右半球与皮层下结构\">超越左脑：右半球与皮层下结构</h2><p>语言并非左脑独享。右半球虽不主导语音和句法，却在韵律、隐喻、笑话、语用推断上不可或缺——右脑损伤的病人常字字听懂却抓不到言外之意。皮层下结构同样参与：基底节和丘脑调控言语的启动、流畅度与时序，帕金森病等基底节疾病常伴言语障碍即为佐证。</p>\n<p>这意味着真实的语言网络是一个跨越双侧皮层、深入皮层下、由多条白质束交织的大系统。任何把语言简化为「两个点加一条线」的图景都已被现代证据超越。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>经典双区模型（布罗卡—韦尼克—弓状束）虽奠基，但现代成像证明其过于简化。</li>\n<li>当代主流是双流模型：腹侧流（颞叶向下）映射声音到意义、负责理解；背侧流（顶叶向上）映射声音到发声、负责复述与产出。</li>\n<li>灰质枢纽靠白质纤维束整合，弓状束与上纵束支撑背侧流，下额枕束与钩束支撑腹侧流，可用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 量化其完整性。</li>\n<li>右半球主管韵律与语用，皮层下结构调控言语时序，语言网络远不止左脑两个点。</li>\n<li>这张脑区与通路地图是理解 <a href=\"../disorders/aphasia-types-syndromes\">失语症类型与综合征</a> 和各类语言加工的解剖前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语言相关脑区与神经通路","id":"语言相关脑区与神经通路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"腹侧流与背侧流：双通路模型","id":"腹侧流与背侧流-双通路模型"},{"level":2,"text":"白质纤维束：连接的高速公路","id":"白质纤维束-连接的高速公路"},{"level":2,"text":"网络视角：语言区如何动态协同","id":"网络视角-语言区如何动态协同"},{"level":2,"text":"超越左脑：右半球与皮层下结构","id":"超越左脑-右半球与皮层下结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"神经语言学导论与语言的脑基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/neurolinguistics/foundations/intro-and-brain-basis"},"next":{"title":"研究方法：失语症、脑成像与 ERP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/neurolinguistics/foundations/methods-aphasia-imaging-erp"}}